  "description": "How can we use infinitly long contexts for LLMs? Inspired from the <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.08467\">gist token</a>, we propose an <strong>online</strong> context compression method. \n                Our method can compress accumulated attention KVs into few [comp] tokens with 5x smaller context memory size."
